      "heading": "A Leading EPC Company\nin Bangladesh",
      "paragraphs": [
        "B-Trac Engineering Ltd. (BTEL), a concern of Bangla Trac Group, is a leading EPC company driving Bangladesh's industrial growth since 2009. We deliver turnkey engineering solutions spanning Substation & Switchgear, Renewable Energy-Solar, MEP-EPC, NALCO Water Treatment Chemicals, and nationwide After Sales Support & Service.",
        "Our success is built on three unwavering commitments: Customer Focus, Quality Excellence, and Timely Delivery. As an ISO 9001:2015 certified organization, BTEL continues to strengthen Bangladesh's industrial landscape through innovation, engineering excellence, and customer trust."
